SUMMARY:[Amber] Commons second reading of the Rural Communities (Public Se
 rvices and Energy) Bill
DESCRIPTION:Flagged Local. A Bill to require the Secretary of State to car
 ry out a review of the adequacy of local government funding for rural com
 munities\, and to require that review to consider the additional costs of
  delivering public services in sparsely populated areas\; to require the 
 Secretary of State to carry out a review of access to healthcare services
  for rural communities\, and to require that review to consider the avail
 ability of radiotherapy treatment in rural areas\; to require the Secreta
 ry of State to publish guidance for healthcare providers and others on re
 ducing inequalities in access to health services between rural and urban 
 areas\; to make provision about energy efficiency standards for new homes
  in rural communities\; to require the Secretary of State to carry out a 
